---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact the desk — Rent Free News" description="Tips, corrections and creator submissions for the Rent Free News desk. Send the claim with its link; we check the primary source.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <div class="kicker text-brand-600">Newsroom</div>
    <h1 class="font-display font-black text-[36px] tracking-[-0.02em] mt-1">Contact the desk</h1>
    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert font-serif mt-4">
      <p>Tips, editorial inquiries, corrections, and creator submissions can be directed to our editorial team:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Editor-in-Chief & Press:</strong> <a href="mailto:editor@rentfreenews.com">editor@rentfreenews.com</a></li>
        <li><strong>General Tips & Newsroom Desk:</strong> <a href="mailto:desk@rentfreenews.com">desk@rentfreenews.com</a></li>
        <li><strong>Corrections:</strong> Report verified inaccuracies via our <a href="/corrections/">Corrections Portal</a>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Send a claim with its link and we will check the primary source. Send a test with its VOD timestamp and we may quote you — with permission, a draft first, and a link back.</p>
      <p>Advertising goes to <a href="mailto:grow@rentfreenews.com">grow@rentfreenews.com</a>. Verdicts are never for sale; see our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> and <a href="/advertise/">advertising ethics</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
